# s3 — cross join (the memory-wall case). Transcribed to .dl6 text from
# v6/sprefa-store/bench/scale-gen.pl fixture_term(s3, ...).
#
# Quadratic by construction: N left rows and N right rows derive N^2 combined
# rows. SCALE.md records tsv2 DNF at every s3 size under the 512 MB Node heap
# ceiling while v1 completed s3/1k. Carried here as a WALL case, not a timing
# case — see CONTRACT.md section 6.

rel left_value(value: text).
rel right_value(value: text).
rel combined(left_side: text, right_side: text).

combined(Left, Right) <- left_value(Left), right_value(Right).
